// # styles/ — Live page chrome
//
// Logline: Split CSS for the static home. Not a second SPA skin.
//
// Setup: Hand-maintained. GitHub Pages, no build. System monospace.
//        No Google Fonts. index.html links these files in <head>.
//
// Beats:
//   1. base.css — tokens, window chrome, skip link, noscript panels.
//   2. panels.css — fullport scroll sections and nav arrows.
//   3. hero.css, bring.css, demo.css, repos.css — home panels.
//   4. Do not restore src/ theme palettes or a hash router.
